00:45:35,300 --> 00:45:41,340
Most of the flood can be contained by the Three Gorges Project Reservoir,

590
00:45:41,940 --> 00:45:44,640
and that will reduce the damage tremendously.

591
00:45:45,440 --> 00:45:46,820
Some disagree.

592
00:45:46,821 --> 00:45:56,060
The Three Gorges Dam will provide some flood protection in the lower reaches, but it's not going to stop all the floods.

593
00:45:56,640 --> 00:46:06,560
But any storms that occur downstream of the dam, which is a very large area, contains huge populations.

594
00:46:07,740 --> 00:46:12,460
This area is susceptible to floods and there's no dams to protect that.

595
00:46:12,461 --> 00:46:18,660
The impact of the Three Gorges Dam on flooding are very ambiguous.

596
00:46:19,340 --> 00:46:27,140
It's a double-edged sword in the sense that the dam will also trap the sediments, the silt.

597
00:46:27,141 --> 00:46:31,360
It will increase the level of the riverbed,

598
00:46:31,720 --> 00:46:36,680
and so it will mean it will increase the flooding risks for the population upstream.

599
00:46:37,780 --> 00:46:42,400
Perhaps the Three Gorges Dam and other flood walls will be able to harness the Yangtze's fury,

600
00:46:42,460 --> 00:46:48,320
But the great flood of 1931 taught a lesson through death and misery.

601
00:46:49,300 --> 00:46:51,700
The dragon is not easily tamed.

602
00:46:54,980 --> 00:46:57,560
Proceeding the great flood of 1931,

603
